    "about": {
      "title": "About  Me",
      "paragraphs": [
        "I’m Maher Adnan, a visual designer based in Iraq with over 17 years of experience in book cover design, visual identities, editorial design, and digital projects. Throughout my career, I have designed more than 700 book covers and worked with publishers, authors, cultural institutions, and brands to create visual work that communicates ideas clearly and leaves a lasting impression.",
        "My approach combines thoughtful concepts, strong typography, and careful attention to detail. I believe good design is not only about appearance; it should understand the idea, serve its purpose, and create a meaningful connection with its audience."
      ],
